  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391591,
    "dDurationMs": 830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pretty"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392635,
    "dDurationMs": 830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "easily"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393679,
    "dDurationMs": 830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "unplug it at the back,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394723,
    "dDurationMs": 1386,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's not exactly useful\nuntil you plug it in again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396311,
    "dDurationMs": 1218,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But at least it's USB Type-C."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397611,
    "dDurationMs": 1352,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's actually kind of solid..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399045,
    "dDurationMs": 1442,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Theoretically, that makes it a bit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 400689,
    "dDurationMs": 2837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more transportable.\nAnd then it also has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404028,
    "dDurationMs": 830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thick"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405072,
    "dDurationMs": 830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "black...\nbezels,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406116,
    "dDurationMs": 830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407160,
    "dDurationMs": 2415,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "might not be a big deal to you,\nbut remember the..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409657,
    "dDurationMs": 1717,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "iMac?\nDo you remember"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411576,
    "dDurationMs": 1186,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when they talked about the..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412844,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "iMac and they switched this thing to...\nwhite"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414886,
    "dDurationMs": 830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bezels"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415930,
    "dDurationMs": 1005,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a couple years ago to make it, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417017,
    "dDurationMs": 3195,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this more friendly family computer that\ncan be placed anywhere in the home?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420294,
    "dDurationMs": 1047,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I still remember that..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421423,
    "dDurationMs": 1235,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I remember them saying that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423330,
    "dDurationMs": 1047,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then yet here we are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424909,
    "dDurationMs": 830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with black bezels"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426128,
    "dDurationMs": 2834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the HomeView.\nMakes you think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429060,
    "dDurationMs": 2807,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I generally,\nI do think that the most important part of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432069,
    "dDurationMs": 1994,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this product...\nis that the display looks..."
